ata-show=\"dialog\" href=\"#\" role=\"button\"> <span class=\"web-icon phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> Kontakt telefoniczny </a>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n        </nav>\n        <div class=\"footer__utilities\">\n         <h2 class=\"sr-only\">Inne informacje</h2>\n         <nav class=\"footer__utilitiesMenu\">\n          <ul class=\"footer__utilitiesLinks\">\n           <li class=\"footer__utilitiesLink\"><a href=\"https://www.ing.pl/kontakt/bank-dostepny-w-mig\" class=\"footer__utilitiesAnchor link--spoleczne\"> <span class=\"web-icon phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> ING dla niesłyszących </a></li>\n           <li class=\"footer__utilitiesLink\"><a href=\"/bank-bez-barier\" class=\"footer__utilitiesAnchor\">Bank bez barier</a></li>\n           <li class=\"footer__utilitiesLink\"><a href=\"/regulamin-serwisu\" class=\"footer__utilitiesAnchor\">Regulamin serwisu</a></li>\n           <li class=\"footer__utilitiesLink\"><a href=\"/indywidualni/tabele-i-regulaminy/regulacje/ochrona-danych-osobowych\" class=\"footer__utilitiesAnchor\">Ochrona danych osobowych</a></li>\n           <li class=\"footer__utilitiesLink\">\n            <button class=\"js-cookie-policy-deputed-settings-button footer__buttonCookie\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\">Ustawienia <span lang=\"en\">cookie</span></button>\n           </li>\n           <li class=\"footer__utilitiesLink\"><a href=\"/indywidualni/tabele-i-regulaminy/regulacje/polityka-plikow-cookie\" class=\"footer__utilitiesAnchor\">Polityka <span lang=\"en\">cookie</span></a></li>\n          </ul>\n         </nav>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"footer__bottom\">\n         <div class=\"footer__copyright\">\n          <p>©&nbsp;<span class=\"js-footer__copyrightYear\"></span> ING Bank Śląski S.A. Wszystkie prawa zastrzeżone.</p>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"footer__socials\">\n          <h2 class=\"sr-only\">Społeczności</h2>\n          <cms-user-component src=\"/_api/core/user-component/footer_social_icons.8bc3c84af5fcfa82e9c6888cfbd85832de978d3448736ae4a66bf1717dc10a21\">\n           <div class=\"content_area\">\n            <ul class=\"footer__socialsList list-clear\">\n             <li class=\"footer__socialsElement\"><a class=\"footer__socialsAnchor footer__socialsAnchor--vFacebook\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/INGPolska\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <span class=\"sr-only\">Facebook</span> <span class=\"web-icon icon-facebook\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> </a></li>\n             <li class=\"footer__socialsElement\"><a class=\"footer__socialsAnchor footer__socialsAnchor--vX\" href=\"https://twitter.com/ING__Polska\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <span class=\"sr-only\">X serwis</span> <span class=\"web-icon icon-x\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> </a></li>\n             <li class=\"footer__socialsElement\"><a class=\"footer__socialsAnchor footer__socialsAnchor--vYoutube\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/INGPolska\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <span class=\"sr-only\">Youtube</span> <span class=\"web-icon icon-youtube\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> </a></li>\n             <li class=\"footer__socialsElement\"><a class=\"footer__socialsAnchor footer__socialsAnchor--vInstagram\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ingpolska\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <span class=\"sr-only\">Instagram</span> <span class=\"web-icon icon-instagram\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> </a></li>\n             <li class=\"footer__socialsElement\"><a class=\"footer__socialsAnchor footer__socialsAnchor--vLinkedin\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/INGPolska\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <span class=\"sr-only\">Linkedin</span> <span class=\"web-icon icon-linkedin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> </a></li>\n             <li class=\"footer__socialsElement\"><a class=\"footer__socialsAnchor footer__socialsAnchor--vTrustpilot\" href=\"http://ing.pl/trustpilot?from=socials\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> <span class=\"sr-only\">Trustpilot</span> <span class=\"web-icon icon-trustpilot\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span> </a></li>\n            </ul>\n           </div>\n          </cms-user-component>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n    <cms-user-component src=\"/_api/core/user-component/infolinia_dialog_footer_KI.e8c12047c574e1b50e168da856ca4a6e1073bc6b46d2884790b704ee62094161\">\n     <div class=\"content_area\">\n      <div aria-hidden=\"true\" aria-labelledby=\"labelledby_infolinia_phone\" class=\"component content dialog-wrapper\" id=\"#infolinia-ki\" role=\"dialog\">\n       <button aria-label=\"Zamknij\" class=\"dialog-close\"><span aria-hidden=\"\" class=\"icon-close web-icon\"></span></button>\n       <h2 class=\"dialog-header medium\" id=\"labelledby_infolinia_phone\">Wsparcie dla klientów indywidualnych</h2>\n       <div class=\"dialog-content\">\n        <div class=\"content_area text-center\">\n         <p>Możesz z nami porozmawiać <a aria-label=\"\" href=\"/indywidualni/odnosniki/direct-link/rozpocznij-czat-wa-w-moim-ing\">na czacie</a> lub do nas <a aria-label=\"\" href=\"/indywidualni/odnosniki/direct-link/pomoc-kontakt-w-moim-ing\">zadzwonić z&nbsp;aplikacji Moje&nbsp;ING</a>.</p>\n         <h3>Infolinia ING Banku Śląskiego</h3>\n         <p>W sprawach bezpieczeństwa zadzwoń na <strong>Telefon alarmowy 24/7</strong> na numer <strong><span class=\"hidden-sm hidden-xs\">+48 32 357 00 12</span><span class=\"hidden-lg hidden-md\"><a aria-label=\"\" href=\"tel:+48 32 357 00 12\"><strong>+48 32 357 00 12</strong></a></span></strong>.</p>\n         <p>W pozostałych sprawach dzwoń na <strong>+48&nbsp;32&nbsp;357&nbsp;00&nbsp;69</strong>.</p>\n         <p class=\"note\">Koszt połączenia według stawek operatora.</p>\n         <div class=\"notification-box warning\" style=\"text-align: left\">\n          <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"warning web-icon\"></span> <span class=\"sr-only\">Uwaga</span>\n          <div>\n           <p>To bank dzwoni do Ciebie?&nbsp;<strong>Upewnij się, że to nie oszustwo.</strong> <a aria-label=\"Więcej o oszustwie na infolinię\" class=\"dialog-close-button\" href=\"/indywidualni/bankowosc-internetowa-mojeing/bezpieczenstwo/weryfikacja-telefonu-z-ing\">Więcej</a></p>\n          </div>\n         </div>\n         <hr>\n         <h3><span lang=\"en\">English</span></h3>\n         <p><span lang=\"en\">Monday-Friday 8:00-18:00</span></p>\n         <h3><span lang=\"ru\">Русскоязычная рабочие дни</span></h3>\n         <p><span lang=\"ru\">8:00-18:00</span></p>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </cms-user-component>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </div>\n</div>\n                    </footer>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/_static/js/client.0185f3e5733828399de9.js\"></script>\n\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/_static/lib/cookie-migration.f358f797adca9f9f13cf.js\" data-no-hash-src=\"/_static/lib/cookie-migration.js\"></script>\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/_static/lib/cookies-manager.fd3b9c7128556bc2af26.js\" data-no-hash-src=\"/_static/lib/cookies-manager.js\"></script>\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/_static/lib/scroll_tracking_adobe.0104cd44e6e44842142e.js\" data-no-hash-src=\"/_static/lib/scroll_tracking_adobe.js\"></script>\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/_static/lib/cookieSEG.e0114eaba2eeb8408826.js\" data-no-hash-src=\"/_static/lib/cookieSEG.js\"></script>\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/_static/lib/vendor/jquery-3.5.1.min.f7f6a5894f1d19ddad6f.js\" data-no-hash-src=\"/_static/lib/vendor/jquery-3.5.1.min.js\"></script>\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/_static/lib/jquery-fn.702b5ab35e6c7b230868.js\" data-no-hash-src=\"/_static/lib/jquery-fn.js\"></script>\n        <script type=\"text/javascript\" src=\"/_static/lib/vendor/mobile-detect-v1.4.3.min.363a80d367