row\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px\\\"><div class=\\\"layout_element narrow_column layout_column col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12\\\"><div id=\\\"component_wrapper_1405313440\\\" class=\\\"layout_element component_wrapper wrapped_html\\\"><div class=\\\"component html component_1405313440 space--topZero space--bottomZero\\\" data-component-id=\\\"1405313440\\\" data-component-type-code=\\\"html\\\" data-js-parameters=\\\"{}\\\" id=\\\"html_1_05062025\\\">\\n <h1 class=\\\"sr-only\\\">ING Bank Śląski</h1>\\n</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\\\"layout_element top-banner dividerHidden  layout_section\\\" style=\\\"padding:0px 0px 0px 0px\\\"><div class=\\\"layout_element layout_container\\\"><div class=\\\"layout_element no_border layout_row row\\\"><div class=\\\"layout_element layout_column col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12\\\"><div id=\\\"component_wrapper_1405313444\\\" class=\\\"layout_element component_wrapper wrapped_hero_banner_upp\\\"><div class=\\\"component hero_banner_upp component_1405313444 space--topZero\\\" data-component-id=\\\"1405313444\\\" data-component-type-code=\\\"hero_banner_upp\\\" data-js-parameters=\\\"{}\\\" id=\\\"hero_banner_upp_1_24062026\\\">\\n <div class=\\\"hero_banner_upp__layout hero_banner_upp--retail\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"hero_banner_upp__container\\\">\\n   <h2 class=\\\"hero_banner_upp__header\\\">Plan: Mieć lepiej. W&nbsp;ING.</h2>\\n   <div class=\\\"hero_banner_upp__content\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"hero_banner_upp__description\\\">\\n     <p>4 Konta w Planach. Odkryj extra korzyści.</p>\\n    </div>\\n    <a aria-label=\\\"Więcej o Kontach w Planach ING\\\" class=\\\"s-link  hero_banner_upp__button\\\" href=\\\"/lp/konto-w-planie?from=mainpage\\\"><span>Więcej o Kontach w Planach<span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\" class=\\\"web-icon hero_banner_upp__buttonIcon \\\"></span></span></a>\\n   </div>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"hero_banner_upp__graphic\\\">\\n   <picture class=\\\"hero_banner_upp__picture\\\"><source media=\\\"(max-width: 960px)\\\" srcset=\\\"/_fileserver/item/kmhnlh0.611d4d22b95c8a343ded172bf06aa8202fe6522f3474685f4859b45f666f72a2\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"hero_banner_upp__image\\\" src=\\\"/_fileserver/item/om9g6fl.82713fadfb420bad0973543870ef0a45674271d6dab6353df4374c910e07de1b\\\"></picture>\\n  </div>\\n </div>\\n</div></div><div id=\\\"component_wrapper_1405313441\\\" class=\\\"layout_element component_wrapper wrapped_content\\\"><div class=\\\"component content component_1405313441 space--topZero\\\" data-component-id=\\\"1405313441\\\" data-component-type-code=\\\"content\\\" data-js-parameters=\\\"{}\\\" id=\\\"content_1_26082026\\\">\\n <div class=\\\"content_area\\\" id=\\\"1405313441\\\">\\n  <p class=\\\"note\\\">Zakres korzyści zależy od wybranego Konta w Planie. Plan to pakiet usług, który udostępniamy z rachunkiem oszczędnościowo-rozliczeniowym. Zapoznaj się z ofertą Planów ING Banku Śląskiego S.A. na ing.pl i sprawdź ich szczegółowe warunki.</p>\\n </div>\\n</div></div><div id=\\\"component_wrapper_1405313450\\\" class=\\\"layout_element component_wrapper wrapped_html\\\"><div class=\\\"component html hide component_1405313450 space--topZero space--bottomZero\\\" data-component-id=\\\"1405313450\\\" data-component-type-code=\\\"html\\\" data-js-parameters=\\\"{}\\\" id=\\\"html_2_24062026\\\">\\n <style>\\n\\n.hero_banner_upp__button>span::before {\\n    background: #7724FF !important;\\n}\\n</style>\\n</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\\\"layout_element layout_section\\\"><div class=\\\"layout_element layout_container\\\" style=\\\"background-color: #F0E8FE\\\"><div class=\\\"layout_element layout_row row\\\"><div class=\\\"layout_element layout_column col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12\\\"><div id=\\\"component_wrapper_1405313452\\\" class=\\\"layout_element component_wrapper wrapped_content\\\"><div class=\\\"component content component_1405313452 space--bottomZero\\\" data-component-id=\\\"1405313452\\\" data-component-type-code=\\\"content\\\" data-js-parameters=\\\"{}\\\" id=\\\"content_2_24062026\\\">\\n <div class=\\\"content_area\\\" id=\\\"1405313452\\\">\\n  <h2 class=\\\"header-upp\\\">Konta osobiste w Planie</h2>\\n </div>\\n</div></div><div id=\\\"component_wrapper_1405313437\\\" class=\\\"layout_element component_wrapper wrapped_small_teaser_tiles\\\"><div class=\\\"component small_teaser_tiles main-features component_1405313437\\\" data-component-id=\\\"1405313437\\\" data-component-type-code=\\\"small_teaser_tiles\\\" data-js-parameters=\\\"{}\\\" id=\\\"small_teaser_tiles_1_24062026\\\">\\n <div class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__inner grid\\\">\\n  <ul class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__elements center\\\">\\n   <li class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__element\\\"><a aria-label=\\\"Więcej o planie ING Go\\\" class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__anchor s-link \\\" href=\\\"/indywidualni/konta-osobiste/konto-w-planie-ing-go\\\"><img alt=\\\"Plan ING Go\\\" class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__image\\\" src=\\\"/_fileserver/item/bwkgjvg.2da80e1e75fa74beaab008a98a4e4b90a7ddd5e997de47d3b75241f8a23de6ff\\\">\\n     <h2 class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__header carousel__headerLabel\\\">Plan ING Go</h2>\\n     <div class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__subheader content_area\\\">\\n      <p>Konto idealne dla Twoich codziennych finansów, bo <strong>najważniejsze funkcje masz za 0&nbsp;zł</strong>. Proste, wygodne i intuicyjne.</p>\\n     </div></a></li>\\n   <li class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__element\\\"><a aria-label=\\\"Więcej o planie ING More\\\" class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__anchor s-link \\\" href=\\\"/indywidualni/konta-osobiste/konto-w-planie-ing-more\\\"><img alt=\\\"Plan ING More\\\" class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__image\\\" src=\\\"/_fileserver/item/bjhzedc.7cbab4d989e493d60c86bf5dcc340b6d9a6c9639134ca8a40d11c3c34039b9ed\\\">\\n     <h2 class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__header carousel__headerLabel\\\">Plan ING More</h2>\\n     <div class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__subheader content_area\\\">\\n      <p><strong></strong>Konto z <strong>udogodnieniami</strong> w <strong>podróży</strong> - lepsze warunki <strong>wymiany walut</strong> i <strong>wypłat</strong> z bankomatów.</p>\\n     </div></a></li>\\n   <li class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__element\\\"><a aria-label=\\\"Więcej o planie ING Extra\\\" class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__anchor s-link \\\" href=\\\"/indywidualni/konta-osobiste/konto-w-planie-ing-extra\\\"><img alt=\\\"Plan ING Extra\\\" class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__image\\\" src=\\\"/_fileserver/item/ausdzol.724ba9d2041cf65a4eeecf0563f6412d72dedab8bcba0e18f1181a559a777b19\\\">\\n     <h2 class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__header carousel__headerLabel\\\">Plan ING Extra</h2>\\n     <div class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__subheader content_area\\\">\\n      <p><strong></strong>Konto z <strong>dodatkowymi usługami</strong>, które wspierają <strong>inwestowanie</strong> i Twoje <strong>podróże</strong> – również zagraniczne<strong></strong></p>\\n     </div></a></li>\\n   <li class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__element\\\"><a aria-label=\\\"Więcej o planie ING Max\\\" class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__anchor s-link \\\" href=\\\"/indywidualni/konta-osobiste/konto-w-planie-ing-max\\\"><img alt=\\\"Plan ING Max\\\" class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__image\\\" src=\\\"/_fileserver/item/17nmsq0.141d50b97b60c5c13a4133c5f571aa73fbe725749fd225bfa309a36b701356e5\\\">\\n     <h2 class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__header carousel__headerLabel\\\">Plan ING Max</h2>\\n     <div class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__subheader content_area\\\">\\n      <p><strong>Najwyższy poziom usług finansowych</strong> dla wymagających, którzy oczekują bankowości <strong>bez ograniczeń</strong>.<strong></strong></p>\\n     </div></a></li>\\n  </ul>\\n </div>\\n</div></div><div id=\\\"component_wrapper_1405313442\\\" class=\\\"layout_element component_wrapper wrapped_content\\\"><div class=\\\"component content component_1405313442 space--topZero\\\" data-component-id=\\\"1405313442\\\" data-component-type-code=\\\"content\\\" data-js-parameters=\\\"{}\\\" id=\\\"content_3_24062026\\\">\\n <div class=\\\"content_area\\\" id=\\\"1405313442\\\">\\n  <p style=\\\"text-align:center\\\"><a aria-label=\\\"Więcej informacji o kontach osobistych w Planie\\\" href=\\\"/indywidualni/konta-osobiste\\\">Więcej informacji</a></p>\\n </div>\\n</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\\\"layout_element dividerHidden layout_section\\\"><div class=\\\"layout_element layout_container\\\"><div class=\\\"layout_element no_border layout_row row\\\"><div class=\\\"layout_element layout_column col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-12 col-lg-12\\\"><div id=\\\"component_wrapper_1405313443\\\" class=\\\"layout_element component_wrapper wrapped_content\\\"><div class=\\\"component content component_1405313443 space--bottomZero\\\" data-component-id=\\\"1405313443\\\" data-component-type-code=\\\"content\\\" data-js-parameters=\\\"{}\\\" id=\\\"content_4_24062026\\\">\\n <div class=\\\"content_area\\\" id=\\\"1405313443\\\">\\n  <h2 class=\\\"header-upp\\\">Szczególnie polecamy</h2>\\n </div>\\n</div></div><div id=\\\"component_wrapper_1405313448\\\" class=\\\"layout_element component_wrapper wrapped_small_teaser_tiles\\\"><div class=\\\"component small_teaser_tiles main-features component_1405313448\\\" data-component-id=\\\"1405313448\\\" data-component-type-code=\\\"small_teaser_tiles\\\" data-js-parameters=\\\"{}\\\" id=\\\"small_teaser_tiles_1_07022023\\\">\\n <div class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__inner grid\\\">\\n  <ul class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__elements center\\\">\\n   <li class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__element\\\"><a class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__anchor s-link \\\" href=\\\"/indywidualni/kredyty-i-pozyczki/kredyt-hipoteczny\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__image\\\" src=\\\"/_fileserver/item/r8v4btg.4ed808e41633a31928402ccf3857e88403e570d2460dba74cd5849e72fd3f754\\\">\\n     <h2 class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__header carousel__headerLabel\\\">Kredyt hipoteczny</h2>\\n     <div class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__subheader content_area\\\">\\n      <p><strong>0 zł prowizji</strong> w ofercie Jesień na swoim -&nbsp;edycja&nbsp;2. Sprawdź, jak złożyć wniosek w&nbsp;pełni zdalnie.&nbsp;<strong></strong><strong>RRSO&nbsp;od&nbsp;6,09%.</strong></p>\\n     </div></a></li>\\n   <li class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__element\\\"><a class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__anchor s-link \\\" href=\\\"/indywidualni/kredyty-i-pozyczki/pozyczka-bez-prowizji-1\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__image\\\" src=\\\"/_fileserver/item/fpbgkkm.d42213241aaf2ed1fe377997d3c5d63441357b012fc7e94451c9c0f8dfb1ecc9\\\">\\n     <h2 class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__header carousel__headerLabel\\\">Superpożyczka</h2>\\n     <div class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__subheader content_area\\\">\\n      <p><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"/_fileserver/item/kaxodqs.69bdefdae744b9eb3477c18881ddf22eec2ea7b3af36e3e5adbdf90944df0ce4\\\" style=\\\"height:12px; vertical-align:baseline; width:12px\\\">&nbsp;<span style=\\\"color:#696969\\\">Jeśli nie masz teraz pożyczki w&nbsp;ING</span>\\n       <br>\\n       <strong>Oprocentowanie już od&nbsp;7,59% i&nbsp;prowizja 0&nbsp;zł </strong>dla&nbsp;kwoty powyżej 30&nbsp;tys.&nbsp;zł. RRSO&nbsp;7,97%</p>\\n     </div></a></li>\\n   <li class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__element\\\"><a class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__anchor s-link \\\" href=\\\"/indywidualni/inwestycje-i-oszczednosci/konto-oszczednosciowe\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__image\\\" src=\\\"/_fileserver/item/kdifzq1.cde88beaee40d5f426eed28dc3df17644548f24b7abd5736c502da21645c4350\\\">\\n     <h2 class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__header carousel__headerLabel\\\">Zacznij oszczędzać</h2>\\n     <div class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__subheader content_area\\\">\\n      <p><img alt=\\\"nowość\\\" src=\\\"/_fileserver/item/kaxodqs.69bdefdae744b9eb3477c18881ddf22eec2ea7b3af36e3e5adbdf90944df0ce4\\\" style=\\\"height:12px; vertical-align:baseline; width:12px\\\">&nbsp;<font color=\\\"#696969\\\">Oferta specjalna</font>\\n       <br>\\n       „Bonus na start” z&nbsp;oprocentowaniem <strong>do&nbsp;5,5% przez 3&nbsp;miesiące<sup>1<span class=\\\"sr-only\\\">zapoznaj się z treścią przypisu w sekcji Objaśnienia</span></sup></strong>, dla kwot <strong>poniżej</strong><strong><strong>&nbsp;4</strong>00&nbsp;tys.&nbsp;zł.</strong></p>\\n     </div></a></li>\\n   <li class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__element\\\"><a class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__anchor s-link \\\" href=\\\"/indywidualni/karty/karty-kredytowe/karta-kredytowa-visa\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__image\\\" src=\\\"/_fileserver/item/kyoir5r.b6c85db54cd6cd58ec6a17cb55a6e6a577a4b47f48986cd66975e60e001b76d7\\\">\\n     <h2 class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__header carousel__headerLabel\\\">Karta kredytowa <span class=\\\"lang-label\\\" lang=\\\"en\\\">Visa i&nbsp;Mastercard</span></h2>\\n     <div class=\\\"small_teaser_tiles__subheader content_area\\\">\\n      <p><img alt=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"/_fileserver/item/kaxodqs.69bdefdae744b9eb3477c18881ddf22eec2ea7b3af36e3e5adbdf90944df0ce4\\\" style=\\\"height:12px; vertical-align:baseline; width:12px\\\">&nbsp;<span style=\\\"color:#696969\\\">Zgarnij do 250&nbsp;zł w&nbsp;promocji</span>\\n       <br>\\n       0 zł za wydanie karty i&nbsp;okres bezodsetkowy do&nbsp;52&nbsp;dni. RRSO&nbsp;od&nbsp;15,56%.</p>\\n     </div></a></li>\\n  </ul>\\n </div>\\n</div></div><div id=\\\"component_wrapper_1405313451\\\" class=\\\"layout_element component_wrapper wrapped_promo_banner_upp\\\"><div class=\\\"component promo_banner_upp component_1405313451\\\" data-component-id=\\\"1405313451\\\" data-component-type-code=\\\"promo_banner_upp\\\" data-js-parameters=\\\"{}\\\" id=\\\"promo_banner_upp_1_25092026\\\">\\n <div class=\\\"promo_banner_upp__wrapper\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"promo_banner_upp__pictureWrapper\\\">\\n   <picture class=\\\"promo_banner_upp__picture\\\"><source media=\\\"(max-width: 600px)\\\" srcset=\\\"/_fileserver/item/6aaxfnl.3b3e0eeebcfdae4b95e9cb00e27705edfad4c6873ec81b1363af021d927d909d\\\"><img alt=\\\"\\\" class=\\\"promo_banner_upp__image\\\" src=\\\"/_fileserver/item/jl5i03k.d77dd20c5e654e22a757ed670ca2a6f3e6ae2e2f3edc0f85e5e93710c8e1158e\\\"></picture>\\n  </div>\\n  <div class=\\\"promo_banner_upp__content promo_banner_upp__content--violet\\\">\\n   <h2 class=\\\"promo_banner_upp__header\\\">Niemożliwe stało się możliwe - kredyt hipoteczny w aplikacji. RRSO 6,09%</h2>\\n   <div class=\\\"promo_banner_upp__description\\\">\\n    <p>Weź w apce Moje ING</p>\\n   </div>\\n   <a aria-label=\\\"Więcj informacji o kredycie hipotecznym w apce Moje ING\\\" class=\\\"s-link button primary-upp\\\" href=\\\"/indywidualni/kredyty-i-pozyczki/kredyt-hipoteczny-online?from=subBanner\\\">Więcej</a>\\n  </div>\\n </div>\\n</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\\\"layout_element dividerHidden layout_section\\\"><div class=\\\"layout_element layout_container\\\"><div class=\\\"layout_element layout_row row\\\"><div class=\\\"layout_element layout_column col-xs-12 col-sm-12 col-md-6 col-lg-6\\\"><div id=\\\"component_wrapper_1405313454\\\" class=\\\"layout_element component_wrapper wrapped_content\\\"><div class=\\\"component content component_1405313454 space--bottomSmall\\\" data-component-id=\\\"1405313454\\\" data-component-type-code=\\\"content\\\" data-js-parameters=\\\"{}\\\" id=\\\"content_1_10012024\\\">\\n <div class=\\\"content_area\\\" id=\\\"1405313454\\\">\\n  <h2 class=\\\"header-upp\\\">Bank dla dzieci</h2>\\n </div>\\n</div></div><div id=\\\"component_wrapper_1405313439\\\" class=\\\"layout_element component_wrapper wrapped_generic_block\\\"><div class=\\\"component generic_block notPrintable component_1405313439 space--topSmall space--bottomSmall\\\" data-component-id=\\\"1405313439\\\" data-component-type-code=\\\"generic_block\\\" data-js-parameters=\\\"{}\\\" id=\\\"generic_block_1_14112025\\\">\\n <div class=\\\"generic_block__wrapper generic_block__with_link\\\">\\n  <div class=\\\"generic_bloc